            <description><![CDATA[<h2>SleekDemo 2.7.0</h2>
<p>Show just your iPhone.</p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>iPhone Only</strong>: for app demos, show your recorded iPhone on its own, big and centred — perfect for vertical videos.</li>
  <li><strong>Smarter Trim Silences</strong>: quiet moments where you're tapping through your iPhone are kept.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
