            <description><![CDATA[<h2>SleekDemo 2.6.0</h2>
<p>Record your iPhone together with your Mac.</p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>iPhone recording</strong>: connect your iPhone or iPad with a cable and record its screen alongside your Mac's.</li>
  <li><strong>Side by side</strong>: your iPhone appears next to your screen in an iPhone frame, left or right, in Natural or Black.</li>
  <li><strong>iPhone sound</strong>: your phone's own sound is recorded too, and you can turn it off.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
